WEBVTT

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
moo-shi

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
presents:

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
http://moo-shi.no-ip.info/ #moo-shi@irc.rizon.net

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:42.180
<i>Matsunami-san!</i>

00:01:47.550 --> 00:01:51.150
<i>The winch worked like a charm!</i>

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:59.910
<i>Just what I'd expect
from a Matsunami Custom!</i>

00:02:04.370 --> 00:02:06.570
<i>Matsunami-san!</i>

00:02:18.850 --> 00:02:20.430
<i>Matsunami-san!</i>

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:31.310
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

00:02:31.730 --> 00:02:33.520
<i>Taiko-san...</i>

00:02:39.670 --> 00:02:40.610
<i>Therefore...</i>

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:46.310
<i>...we'd like to hire you all
to protect our secret laboratory.</i>

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:47.740
<i>Laboratory?</i>

00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:51.720
<i>Don't tell me we're gonna
be decoys again like last time...</i>

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:56.690
<i>Don't worry. This time it
is a genuine security detail.</i>

00:02:56.690 --> 00:03:02.120
<i>And because it is a critical RHG site,
we'd like your assistance.</i>

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:06.560
<i>Ain't no reason to say no
when you put it like that!</i>

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:08.630
<i>You can count on us, Natsu-ne!</i>

00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:09.840
<i>Koizumi-san.</i>

00:03:11.630 --> 00:03:12.950
<i>Koizumi-san?</i>

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:14.840
<i>Y-yes?!</i>

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:17.070
<i>Can we count on you as well?</i>

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:18.530
<i>Eh? For what?</i>

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:22.280
<i>As I said, you'll be
protecting the laboratory.</i>

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:24.280
<i>R-right! No problem!</i>

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:31.950
<i>That was one hell of a fire!</i>

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:36.620
<i>- Think it was the welding gas?
- There was nitro lying around, too...</i>

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:43.220
<i>Oh, that reminds me.
I got an interesting job.</i>

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:49.470
<i>It was an order to make a
rocket winch just like ol' Kanta's.</i>

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:53.570
<i>Taiko-san!</i>

00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:56.270
<i>Here you are!</i>

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:02.980
<i>Only three of
Matsunami-san's children survived,</i>

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:06.280
<i>but it looks like they're going
to be sold to slave traders</i>

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:09.560
<i>to pay for the damages
and their own medical costs...</i>

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:12.790
<i>I feel so bad for the kids...</i>

00:04:13.130 --> 00:04:16.290
<i>They're lucky they didn't
get tossed into the desert...</i>

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:20.340
<i>What?</i>

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:22.040
<i>Are you all right, Taiko-san?</i>

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:23.310
<i>Me?</i>

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:25.900
<i>You don't seem in very high spirits...</i>

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:33.020
<i>Idiot! I never expected a dimwit
like you to worry about me!</i>

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:34.740
<i>I-I'm sorry!</i>

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:36.720
<i>So, what do you want?</i>

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:39.390
<i>Oh, they said we're leaving soon!</i>

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:39.980
<i>Got it.</i>

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:45.360
<i>Looks like that eager beaver
ain't here today.</i>

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:47.350
<i>You mean Kaido?</i>

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:52.500
<i>He's already got a job at the lab
guardin' old man Kaizuka.</i>

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:58.170
<i>What's the matter, Taiko-chan?
You don't seem too cheery...</i>

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:05.320
<i>Don't worry! We'll be at the lab
in no time flat, just like last time!</i>

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:06.920
<i>That's not it...</i>

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:09.360
<i>What's the deal? This ain't like you.</i>

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:10.890
<i>Umm...</i>

00:05:11.140 --> 00:05:14.930
<i>What do you suppose old Kaizuka
is working on at his lab?</i>

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:20.150
<i>Probably one of them awesome
Dark Age machine guns, you know?</i>

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:24.150
<i>Like maybe the legendary M134 Minigun?!</i>

00:05:25.310 --> 00:05:27.400
<i>Get with the program.</i>

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:32.720
<i>Old Kaizuka made a huge fortune
off of that "Game of Life".</i>

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:33.910
<i>Which means...</i>

00:05:34.820 --> 00:05:35.620
<i>Means?</i>

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:40.850
<i>What he's making at the lab is...
"The Game of Eccentric Destiny"!</i>

00:05:40.850 --> 00:05:42.450
<i>That's gotta be it!</i>

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:47.630
<i>It's a game three times more
exciting than the "Game of Life"!</i>

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:50.290
<i>Let's all play it together!</i>

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:53.490
<i>What is this?</i>

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:56.020
<i>Wow!</i>

00:05:56.020 --> 00:05:57.830
<i>W-whoa!</i>

00:06:14.110 --> 00:06:16.260
<i>The Great Kanto Crater.</i>

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:19.570
<i>A giant depression born
from the tectonic activity</i>

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:22.420
<i>that took place
at the end of the Dark Age.</i>

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:27.930
<i>Around 10 kilometers in diameter
and 1000 meters below sea level...</i>

00:06:28.920 --> 00:06:32.010
<i>Also known as "Hell's Abaddon".</i>

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:36.670
<i>Which makes it the perfect
location for a secret laboratory.</i>

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:38.520
<i>Everyone ready?!</i>

00:06:39.240 --> 00:06:39.960
<i>Yes!</i>

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:41.020
<i>Leave it to us!</i>

00:06:41.590 --> 00:06:44.880
<i>Say, did Amagumo not come this time?</i>

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:48.620
<i>He declined. Said this kind
of work isn't worth it...</i>

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:50.060
<i>What a surprise.</i>

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:51.840
<i>Well, let's go, everyone!</i>

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:52.700
<i>Right!</i>

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:54.700
<i>Oh, look.</i>

00:06:55.460 --> 00:06:58.900
<i>That flat-chested girl's still at it!</i>

00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:00.710
<i>Flat chest? Who?</i>

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:03.270
<i>The Sunabouzu's old student.</i>

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:04.210
<i>Never heard of her.</i>

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:08.710
<i>She's no big deal.
Anyways, did word come in?</i>

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:13.130
<i>Yeah. The operation begins in 12 hours.</i>

00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:14.310
<i>12 hours...</i>

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:18.720
<i>So that's when Flatty's
short life will come to an end.</i>

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:23.150
<i>Ending life without
ever having a chest...</i>

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:25.650
<i>Poor thing.</i>

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:31.470
<i>We've gone pretty far down...</i>

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:34.160
<i>We still not at the bottom?</i>

00:07:36.780 --> 00:07:39.190
<i>Hey, now! You alright, Mitsuru?!</i>

00:07:39.190 --> 00:07:41.040
<i>I-I'm fine!</i>

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:43.870
<i>Want us to carry some stuff?</i>

00:07:43.870 --> 00:07:48.750
<i>No! I... want to be able
to take care of myself!</i>

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:51.500
<i>I see...</i>

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:56.180
<i>I want to be able
to take care of myself!</i>

00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:58.220
<i>Will you get real?!</i>

00:07:58.340 --> 00:08:03.950
<i>But I'm upset I wasn't able to
clean up my own mess back there!</i>

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:07.600
<i>This kid's... just like I was...</i>

00:08:08.990 --> 00:08:10.780
<i>No! That's not true!</i>

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:14.930
<i>Come on! Show some more effort
if you're gonna say that!</i>

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:17.530
<i>R-right! This is nothing at all!</i>

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:20.570
<i>Yeah, right.</i>

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:27.460
<i>I-I saw Kaido-san the other day
and realized I need to work harder...</i>

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:32.920
<i>Huh? If you like that eager moron
so much, why not be his pupil?</i>

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:35.340
<i>N-no! I just meant...</i>

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:41.810
<i>We understand, Mitsuru!
You like Taiko-chan!</i>

00:08:42.190 --> 00:08:44.440
<i>- Eh? Eh?!
- Eh?!</i>

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:46.020
<i>Bull's-eye?!</i>

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:46.990
<i>G-get serious!</i>

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:50.810
<i>This idiot isn't any help at all
when he's most needed!</i>

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:53.470
<i>I-I'm sorry! I'm sorry!</i>

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:54.820
<i>Let's get a move-on.</i>

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:56.160
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:08:58.240 --> 00:08:59.690
<i>What the?</i>

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:03.360
<i>Sure it ain't just a sandstorm?</i>

00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:05.710
<i>See anything on your monitor, Taiko-chan?</i>

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:13.170
<i>No good. It's just too far...</i>

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:16.430
<i>I have a bad feeling about this.
Let's move on ahead!</i>

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:17.510
<i>Right!</i>

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:46.160
<i>Well, Tanigawa-kun?</i>

00:09:46.490 --> 00:09:48.120
<i>Oh, Guildhead!</i>

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:51.170
<i>Appears to be going well.</i>

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:54.880
<i>The cultivation should be complete
after about two more weeks!</i>

00:09:55.450 --> 00:10:01.640
<i>So, counting the already-completed
00 Series, we'll have 18 total.</i>

00:10:02.420 --> 00:10:08.540
<i>The 01 Series uses that data,
so they'll be even more powered up!</i>

00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:14.360
<i>Still, seeing all these
Dark Age weapons lined up like this</i>

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.940
<i>isn't a pleasant sight at all...</i>

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:20.990
<i>Kaido-kun. I know what you want to say.</i>

00:10:20.990 --> 00:10:24.730
<i>But if we're to topple the government
that so atrociously oppresses</i>

00:10:24.730 --> 00:10:28.320
<i>the denizens of the Great Kanto Desert,</i>

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:31.400
<i>we will need these guardians' help.</i>

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:33.750
<i>I realize that, but...</i>

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:36.370
<i>We'll fight fire with fire.</i>

00:10:36.370 --> 00:10:39.480
<i>And once all has been accomplished,</i>

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:45.180
<i>I, together with these guardians,
will leave the center stage of history!</i>

00:10:46.990 --> 00:10:47.930
<i>Kaido-kun!</i>

00:10:49.230 --> 00:10:51.230
<i>Tanigawa-kun!</i>

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:55.730
<i>Once I do, you'll be the leading
characters of the Great Kanto Desert!</i>

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:58.410
<i>Use your youthful vigor and zeal</i>

00:10:58.410 --> 00:11:03.780
<i>to create a new Great Kanto Desert,
free of starvation and poverty!</i>

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:11.390
<i>Understood! Not even
a single ant will get near!</i>

00:11:11.390 --> 00:11:14.720
<i>And I'll speed up the development
of the specialized equipment!</i>

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:19.990
<i>- Let's go! Let's do it! Fight!
- Yeah! All right!</i>

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:26.960
<i>Each and every one is
working so diligently.</i>

00:11:29.270 --> 00:11:33.350
<i>It would've been even better
if he was alive...</i>

00:11:34.010 --> 00:11:39.470
<i>Though I guess he wasn't the kind
to be so easily controlled...</i>

00:11:47.990 --> 00:11:50.030
<i>So that's their laboratory?</i>

00:11:50.760 --> 00:11:53.530
<i>I sent Ayukawa and Samesuga
to scope it out.</i>

00:11:53.530 --> 00:11:55.560
<i>They should be reporting soon.</i>

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:10.970
<i>One on the east...</i>

00:12:11.470 --> 00:12:12.930
<i>One on the west...</i>

00:12:13.450 --> 00:12:14.390
<i>And...</i>

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:18.860
<i>...one human. He's giving them orders.</i>

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:23.340
<i>Is this when one should laugh?</i>

00:12:23.650 --> 00:12:28.860
<i>No, it's just that both we and
they possess superhuman strength,</i>

00:12:28.860 --> 00:12:32.030
<i>yet we're forced to
rely on humans in the end.</i>

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:34.120
<i>As Master might put it:</i>

00:12:34.740 --> 00:12:39.020
<i>"You ain't never gonna be on
the front lines like that."</i>

00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:41.110
<i>Shall we go?</i>

00:12:41.310 --> 00:12:42.310
<i>Yes.</i>

00:12:42.310 --> 00:12:44.030
<i>They've gotten smarter?</i>

00:12:45.850 --> 00:12:46.720
<i>Yes.</i>

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:51.260
<i>Didn't you think so when you fought
the robot soldier the other day?</i>

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:53.530
<i>Yeah...</i>

00:12:53.970 --> 00:12:59.630
<i>It did seem to act smarter than
the guy we fought half a year ago.</i>

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:03.260
<i>Their intelligence level
has definitely improved.</i>

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:07.010
<i>Come to think of it, he did
say "Master" or something...</i>

00:13:07.770 --> 00:13:10.840
<i>So there's someone
teaching 'em how to fight?!</i>

00:13:10.840 --> 00:13:13.040
<i>A robot master?</i>

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:14.190
<i>Like this?!</i>

00:13:16.110 --> 00:13:19.080
<i>It's most likely
a vile and crafty human</i>

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:23.820
<i>with extensive combat experience
and an arsenal of secret techniques.</i>

00:13:24.230 --> 00:13:27.280
<i>I think that's who's
instructing them now.</i>

00:13:28.890 --> 00:13:30.590
<i>Vile and crafty?</i>

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:35.600
<i>I see. Only three in the front.</i>

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:40.500
<i>So the factionist scum still haven't
gotten to mass production yet...</i>

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:43.170
<i>I believe now is the time to strike.</i>

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:44.790
<i>I am of the same opinion.</i>

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:48.210
<i>- No. We'll wait a little more.
- But...</i>

00:13:48.210 --> 00:13:50.820
<i>Your master says likewise.</i>

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:54.920
<i>It is an honor to
have you come all this way!</i>

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:58.520
<i>The master himself will be
taking command this time!</i>

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:02.650
<i>There are 12 of you!
Failure will not be tolerated!</i>

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:10.100
<i>Man... Not only is it hard to
walk with the rubble and debris...</i>

00:14:10.100 --> 00:14:12.100
<i>It's hard to breathe, too...</i>

00:14:12.100 --> 00:14:14.400
<i>Don't give up. We're almost there.</i>

00:14:14.770 --> 00:14:16.200
<i>Anyways, Taiko-chan.</i>

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:16.840
<i>Yes?</i>

00:14:16.840 --> 00:14:19.430
<i>You should really
do somethin' about that.</i>

00:14:22.080 --> 00:14:28.310
<i>They all got... such heavy equipment...
but don't slow down at all...</i>

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:34.530
<i>Too slow!</i>

00:14:36.290 --> 00:14:40.960
<i>Idiot! Dumbass! Nitwit! If I'd been
a bandit, you'd be dead by now!</i>

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:43.200
<i>I-I'm sorry! I'm sorry!</i>

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:44.900
<i>C'mon! C'mon! Strip! Strip!</i>

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:47.570
<i>Wearin' all this stuff like a twerp!</i>

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:49.470
<i>What are you doing, Taiko-san?!</i>

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:52.810
<i>C'mon! The TNT and C4, too!
Hand it all over!</i>

00:14:52.810 --> 00:14:55.380
<i>It's all useless in your hands!</i>

00:14:55.380 --> 00:14:57.670
<i>Strip down to your underwear!</i>

00:14:58.550 --> 00:15:00.650
<i>- I'm gonna be raped!
- Dumbass!</i>

00:15:02.550 --> 00:15:05.250
<i>25 bullets. One liter of water.</i>

00:15:06.150 --> 00:15:07.990
<i>Now go back to the truck!</i>

00:15:07.990 --> 00:15:09.620
<i>But... I...</i>

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:11.120
<i>Just hurry and do it!</i>

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:12.960
<i>Taiko-san, I like...</i>

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:13.790
<i>Shut it!</i>

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:20.830
<i>If you care so much, then make it
back alive and out of our way!</i>

00:15:39.850 --> 00:15:41.820
<i>Sorry for the delay!</i>

00:15:43.390 --> 00:15:45.260
<i>Oh? What happened to Mitsuru?</i>

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:50.820
<i>I gave that bum the bare essentials
and sent him back to the truck!</i>

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:53.900
<i>- Talk about strict!
- You bet!</i>

00:15:53.900 --> 00:15:56.870
<i>I got no sympathy for
guys who can't wipe their own ass!</i>

00:15:56.870 --> 00:15:59.520
<i>You sure it ain't just "tough love"?!</i>

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:01.610
<i>N-no!</i>

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:02.690
<i>Wait!</i>

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:04.030
<i>What's that?!</i>

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:07.320
<i>What the?</i>

00:16:08.350 --> 00:16:11.050
<i>I've never seen anything like it...</i>

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:13.600
<i>It's beautiful...</i>

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:17.140
<i>Huh?</i>

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:21.760
<i>- What was that?
- An explosion?</i>

00:16:21.760 --> 00:16:23.600
<i>It's from the valley floor!</i>

00:16:23.940 --> 00:16:25.180
<i>The lab is down there!</i>

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:34.250
<i>The lab is... on fire!</i>

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:41.050
<i>Where's the enemy?!</i>

00:16:41.050 --> 00:16:42.520
<i>Around the other side!</i>

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:45.560
<i>They could have
invisibility equipment again!</i>

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:47.260
<i>Watch your back!</i>

00:16:47.710 --> 00:16:48.610
<i>Natsuko-san!</i>

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:50.810
<i>Isn't he...</i>

00:16:51.310 --> 00:16:54.010
<i>No doubt about it! It's a guardian!</i>

00:16:54.600 --> 00:16:59.070
<i>That monster you and Kanta
fought at the skeleton city?</i>

00:16:59.070 --> 00:17:00.040
<i>There's more!</i>

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:02.600
<i>W-what the heck?!</i>

00:17:02.600 --> 00:17:07.120
<i>What are surviving monsters
of the Dark Age doing here?!</i>

00:17:09.180 --> 00:17:13.850
<i>It couldn't be! Was old man
Kaizuka's research here actually...</i>

00:17:14.080 --> 00:17:14.850
<i>That's right.</i>

00:17:14.850 --> 00:17:20.170
<i>He's mass-producing these guardians
to take on the robot soldiers.</i>

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:22.030
<i>Say what?!</i>

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:26.910
<i>So we were called here
to protect some monsters?!</i>

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:30.300
<i>Don't you understand?</i>

00:17:30.950 --> 00:17:35.420
<i>The only way to fight those monsters
is to get monsters of our own!</i>

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:37.470
<i>B-but!</i>

00:17:41.260 --> 00:17:42.570
<i>Look out, Natsuko!</i>

00:17:43.310 --> 00:17:46.480
<i>Heavy artillery fire!
88-millimeter class!</i>

00:17:52.020 --> 00:17:53.570
<i>Look over there!</i>

00:17:58.360 --> 00:17:59.530
<i>Goodnight</i>

00:17:59.530 --> 00:18:01.260
<i>Say goodnight</i>

00:17:59.530 --> 00:18:01.260
<i>Is that?!</i>

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:02.400
<i>Say goodnight</i>

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:02.400
<i>No doubt about it!</i>

00:18:02.820 --> 00:18:05.620
<i>Embraced by the scorching sand</i>

00:18:02.820 --> 00:18:05.620
<i>I-it's the Kong!</i>

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:12.050
<i>Embraced by the scorching sand
Goodnight. Say Goodnight</i>

00:18:07.300 --> 00:18:08.510
<i>Kong?</i>

00:18:09.010 --> 00:18:12.020
<i>A hover-tank we
and Kanta once destroyed.</i>

00:18:12.330 --> 00:18:14.720
<i>- But what's it doing here?!
- Hell if I know!</i>

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:23.050
<i>Goodnight. Say goodnight</i>

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:27.320
<i>With your hopes dashed
and all your dreams gone</i>

00:18:27.320 --> 00:18:32.560
<i>Goodnight, goodnight, goodnight</i>

00:18:32.560 --> 00:18:37.090
<i>You're a warrior</i>

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:42.280
<i>but go to sleep like an infant now</i>

00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:42.280
<i>Shit! Run!</i>

00:18:44.240 --> 00:18:52.710
<i>But go to sleep like an infant now</i>

00:18:44.240 --> 00:18:48.580
<i>So that's what that dust cloud
was when we went down the crater!</i>

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:50.850
<i>We don't stand a chance
against that monster!</i>

00:18:51.710 --> 00:18:55.730
<i>Even if it is a Dark Age relic,
a direct hit from its cannon would be...</i>

00:18:58.180 --> 00:18:59.750
<i>We're history if we don't do somethin'!</i>

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:01.970
<i>Kaizuka-san must survive!</i>

00:19:05.430 --> 00:19:06.560
<i>Natsuko?!</i>

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:10.520
<i>Goodnight, say goodnight</i>

00:19:07.060 --> 00:19:10.400
<i>You're just running to your death!</i>

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:12.630
<i>Come back, Natsuko!</i>

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:16.010
<i>Lay your exhausted body down</i>

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:13.780
<i>I'm going, too!</i>

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:16.010
<i>T-T-Taiko-chan?!</i>

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:20.920
<i>Goodnight, say goodnight</i>

00:19:20.740 --> 00:19:22.760
<i>Natsuko-san!</i>

00:19:27.480 --> 00:19:31.140
<i>Goodnight, say goodnight</i>

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:29.780
<i>Natsuko-san!</i>

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:35.770
<i>You threw out your things long ago</i>

00:19:35.090 --> 00:19:36.950
<i>This floor's falling apart...</i>

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:41.000
<i>You don't have one thing left</i>

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:38.540
<i>Where's Natsuko-san?!</i>

00:19:39.100 --> 00:19:41.000
<i>Hey! Taiko-chan!</i>

00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:45.460
<i>Everyone will realize it</i>

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:45.460
<i>Man, that sucked...</i>

00:19:45.500 --> 00:20:01.050
<i>So from tomorrow on,
forget everything and go to sleep</i>

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:50.280
<i>These... look like underground ruins...</i>

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:51.650
<i>So... where's Natsuko?</i>

00:19:51.900 --> 00:19:54.040
<i>I dunno where she went...</i>

00:20:01.050 --> 00:20:09.450
<i>You beat withered arms with whips</i>

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:06.190
<i>T-that's...</i>

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:08.950
<i>A guardian?!</i>

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:11.130
<i>Aki-niichan!</i>

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:19.700
<i>And drink up the blood of fallen prey</i>

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:13.050
<i>S-should we just shoot it?!</i>

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:20.970
<i>The Kong?!</i>

00:20:20.970 --> 00:20:22.710
<i>All the way in here?!</i>

00:20:21.130 --> 00:20:28.860
<i>because this world
is always a battleground</i>

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:25.480
<i>Oh, you're still alive!</i>

00:20:26.380 --> 00:20:28.490
<i>You sure are stubborn, Flatty.</i>

00:20:28.980 --> 00:20:30.040
<i>That voice!</i>

00:20:37.970 --> 00:20:40.510
<i>Asagiri Junko! Why are you...</i>

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:45.020
<i>Sorry! I made an agreement with him.</i>

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:51.510
<i>I'm here to kill old man Kaizuka
and all the members of this lab!</i>

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:52.810
<i>"Him"?</i>

00:20:53.130 --> 00:20:53.960
<i>Bitch!</i>

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:56.200
<i>Like hell you will!</i>

00:20:58.310 --> 00:20:59.040
<i>What the?!</i>

00:20:59.040 --> 00:21:00.640
<i>Where'd the shots come from?!</i>

00:21:01.080 --> 00:21:03.350
<i>W-who's there?! Who's there?!</i>

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:07.600
<i>B-Bro!</i>

00:21:08.130 --> 00:21:08.690
<i>What?</i>

00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:13.160
<i>What?!</i>

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:15.280
<i>W-when did they...</i>

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:19.940
<i>W-w-we're surrounded!</i>

00:21:21.990 --> 00:21:26.400
<i>You see? Now why don't you
drop the guns and surrender?!</i>

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:29.440
<i>B-Bro!</i>

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:32.300
<i>No!</i>

00:21:36.870 --> 00:21:39.260
<i>- What the?!
- Don't tell me they're...</i>

00:21:46.060 --> 00:21:46.780
<i>Balloons?</i>

00:21:47.180 --> 00:21:49.080
<i>How did you know, Taiko-chan?!</i>

00:21:49.450 --> 00:21:50.530
<i>Their feet.</i>

00:21:50.530 --> 00:21:51.780
<i>Their feet?</i>

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:53.830
<i>They were standing on weak concrete,</i>

00:21:54.360 --> 00:21:57.340
<i>but there were no cracks at their feet.</i>

00:21:59.330 --> 00:22:02.400
Nice assessment of the situation, Kosuna.

00:22:03.770 --> 00:22:09.270
I guess you've matured a bit if
you could see through my balloons.

00:22:09.670 --> 00:22:10.700
<i>That voice!</i>

00:22:14.770 --> 00:22:15.820
<i>I-it can't be!</i>

00:22:19.770 --> 00:22:21.560
This is the perfect time...

00:22:20.790 --> 00:22:24.990
<i>TO BE CONCLUDED NEXT EPISODE</i>

00:22:21.560 --> 00:22:23.560
...to end this episode!

00:23:54.950 --> 00:23:56.760
<i>- Ghost of the Desert, Sunabouzu here!
- Skilled Beauty Kosuna here!</i>

00:23:56.760 --> 00:23:58.930
<i>Master! Why are you showing up now?</i>

00:23:58.930 --> 00:24:01.320
<i>Moron! I'll always be the main character!</i>

00:24:01.320 --> 00:24:03.150
<i>No fair! This is the final preview, too!</i>

00:24:03.150 --> 00:24:04.460
<i>- Which is why I'm doing it!
- No, me!</i>

00:24:04.460 --> 00:24:05.210
<i>- Anyways, the next episode
- Anyways, the next episode</i>

00:24:05.210 --> 00:24:06.230
<i>- is the final chapter!
- Is the final chapter!</i>

00:24:06.230 --> 00:24:07.260
<i>- "Taiko and...
...Kanta"!</i>

00:24:07.260 --> 00:24:08.850
<i>Miss it and you'll have
to catch it on stage!</i>

00:24:08.850 --> 00:24:09.500
<i>No way!</i>
